<title>USA: Symmetricom hires investment banker.</title>
<headline>Symmetricom hires investment banker.</headline>
<dateline>SAN JOSE, Calif. 1997-08-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>SymmetriCom Inc said Monday it has retained Alex Brown &amp; Sons for assistance in evaluating &quot;strategic alternatives for maximizing shareholder value.&quot;</p>
<p>A company spokesman declined to elaborate. Last month, however, it announced it was considering various ways to boost shareholder value including spinning off one or both of its operating units, or selling the company outright.</p>
<p>SymmetriCom's two operating units are its Telecom Solutions, which supplies advanced network synchronization systems and intelligent access systems; and Linfinity Microelectronics, a maker of linear and mixed signal integrated circuits.</p>
